(*---
description: Explores init membership and next two_actions with check action_constraint.
ref: tlc2/tool/impl/Tool.java#getInitStates; tlc2/tool/impl/Tool.java#getNextStates
features:
  - state-space
outcome: any
config: |
  INIT Init
  NEXT Next
  ACTION_CONSTRAINT Con
---*)
---- MODULE space_membership__two_actions__action_constraint ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLES x, y
vars == <<x, y>>
Assign(a, b) == x = a /\ y = b
Same(a, b) == a = a /\ b = b
Init == x \in 0..1 /\ y \in {0}
Next == (x' = x /\ y' = y) \/ (UNCHANGED vars)
Con == x' = x
====

